# Send a text message. The answer says whether it was queued; the progress is published as TxStatus with request_id.
# The medium has its own size limit (the acoustic medium's single packet is 54 bytes); a longer text is refused as
# invalid, never cut.
string recipient
string text
uint8 medium            # TextMessage MEDIUM_ constant
more_interfaces/CommandAuth auth
---
uint32 request_id
more_interfaces/CommandResult result
